sequenceDiagram
    participant Sender as Sender (HTTP Client)
    participant Receiver as Receiver (HTTP Server)

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Discovery Phase
    alt Multicast Discovery
        Sender->>Receiver: UDP Multicast Announcement
        Note over Sender: {alias, version: "3.0", deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, port, protocol, announce: true}
        Receiver->>Sender: POST /api/localsend/v3/register
        Note over Receiver: {alias, version: "3.0", deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, port, protocol, download}
    else HTTP Discovery (Legacy)
        Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/register
        Note over Sender: {alias, version: "3.0", deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, port, protocol, download}
        Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
        Note over Receiver: {alias, version: "3.0", deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, download}
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Nonce Exchange
    Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/nonce
    Note over Sender: {nonce: sender_nonce_base64}
    Note over Receiver: Validate nonce format & content
    Note over Receiver: Store sender_nonce in received_nonce_map
    Note over Receiver: Generate receiver_nonce
    Note over Receiver: Store receiver_nonce in generated_nonce_map
    Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
    Note over Receiver: {nonce: receiver_nonce_base64}
    Note over Sender,Receiver: Combined nonce = sender_nonce || receiver_nonce

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Token Exchange (Re-register with Auth)
    Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/register
    Note over Sender: {alias, version: "3.0", deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, port, protocol, download, token: signed_token_with_nonce}
    Note over Receiver: Retrieve stored nonces
    Note over Receiver: Verify sender token signature with nonce

    alt Token verification fails
        Receiver-->>Sender: 401 Unauthorized
        Note over Receiver: {status: "INVALID_SIGNATURE"}
        Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection terminated
    else Token valid, PIN required
        Receiver-->>Sender: 401 Unauthorized
        Note over Receiver: {status: "PIN_REQUIRED", alias, version, deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, download, token: receiver_signed_token}
    else Token valid, no PIN required
        Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
        Note over Receiver: {status: "OK", alias, version, deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, download, token: receiver_signed_token}
    end
    Note over Sender: Verify receiver token with nonce

    opt Receiver requires PIN
        loop Until correct PIN or max attempts
            Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/prepare-upload?pin=123456
            Note over Sender: {info: {...}, files: {...}}
            alt Correct PIN
                Note over Receiver: PIN verified, proceed
            else Wrong PIN
                Receiver-->>Sender: 401 Unauthorized
                Note over Receiver: {error: "Invalid PIN"}
            else Too many attempts
                Receiver-->>Sender: 429 Too Many Requests
                Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection terminated
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: File Transfer Preparation
    Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/prepare-upload?pin=123456
    Note over Sender: {info: {alias, version, deviceModel, deviceType, fingerprint, port, protocol, download}, files: {fileId: {id, fileName, size, fileType, sha256, preview, metadata}}}
    Note over Receiver: Validate session/token
    Note over Receiver: User reviews file list

    alt User requests pairing
        Receiver-->>Sender: 202 Accepted
        Note over Receiver: {status: "PAIR_REQUESTED", publicKey: receiver_public_key, sessionId}
        Note over Sender: Verify receiver token with public key
        Note over Sender: Prompt user for pairing approval

        alt Sender accepts pairing
            Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/pair
            Note over Sender: {sessionId, accepted: true, publicKey: sender_public_key}
            Note over Receiver: Verify sender token with provided public key
            Note over Receiver: Store paired public key
            Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
            Note over Receiver: {status: "OK", files: {fileId: fileToken}}
        else Sender declines pairing
            Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/pair
            Note over Sender: {sessionId, accepted: false}
            Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
            Note over Receiver: {status: "PAIR_DECLINED"}
            Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection terminated
        end
    else User declines transfer
        Receiver-->>Sender: 403 Forbidden
        Note over Sender,Receiver: Connection terminated
    else User accepts transfer (all or partial)
        Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
        Note over Receiver: {sessionId, files: {fileId: fileToken}}
        Note over Receiver: Generate unique token per accepted file
    else No files selected
        Receiver-->>Sender: 204 No Content
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Upload Files
    loop For each accepted file
        Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/upload?sessionId={sessionId}&fileId={fileId}&token={fileToken}
        Note over Sender: Binary file data in request body
        Note over Receiver: Validate sessionId, fileId, and fileToken
        Note over Receiver: Validate sender IP matches session

        alt Valid token and session
            Note over Receiver: Stream and save file
            Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
        else Invalid token or IP
            Receiver-->>Sender: 403 Forbidden
        else Session conflict
            Receiver-->>Sender: 409 Conflict
        end
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Transfer Complete or Cancel
    alt Transfer completed successfully
        Note over Sender,Receiver: All files uploaded
    else Sender cancels
        Sender->>Receiver: POST /api/localsend/v3/cancel?sessionId={sessionId}
        Receiver-->>Sender: 200 OK
        Note over Receiver: Clean up session & tokens
    end

    Note over Sender,Receiver: Session Cleanup
    Note over Receiver: Invalidate sessionId and file tokens
    Note over Receiver: Clear nonce mappings